==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|grǫftr}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*graftuz}}. Cognate with the {{cog|ang|græft}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈkrœftʏr/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|œftʏr}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# the act of [[digging]]
# the act of [[engraving]]
# [[pus]]
# [[burial]], [[interment]]
# [[remains]] dug up from a grave

